			"Message": "refactor(Maintain): Atomize Run/CLI/mod.rs into directory-based submodules\n\nSplit the monolithic Run/CLI/mod.rs (967 lines) into a directory-based module\nstructure, continuing the atomization pattern from Build/CLI.\n\nThe new layout extracts:\n- Run/CLI/mod.rs — module root re-exporting sub-modules with shared parser\n  helpers (parse_profile_name, parse_key_val)\n- Run/CLI/Cli.rs — Cli struct, its impl block, and all private helpers\n  (resolve_profile_name, apply_overrides, print_resolved_environment,\n  is_run_env_var)\n- Run/CLI/Commands.rs — Commands enum with variant-level clap attributes\n- Run/CLI/OutputFormat.rs — OutputFormat enum with Display impl\n\nAlso update the Run::CLI::Cli path in Library.rs to the new\nRun::CLI::Cli::Cli qualified path, reflecting the submodule nesting.\n\nNo behavioral changes — purely structural refactoring for modularity.",
